WEBVTT

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.320
So that's Megrez, the
fourth Septentrion?

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.250
Looks a lot different
from yesterday's, huh?

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.700
You all plan to take
that thing on, right?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.120
That's right! We're counting on you.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.490
It's not like I'm your
subordinate, you know.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.450
But you can count on me.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.480
How dare you do this to my city?!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.590
So, we're really the only ones fighting?

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.060
It's actually better this way.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.470
I want no unnecessary sacrifices.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.010
Yes. We have Suzaku and Kikuri-Hime,

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.130
so we'll be fine, right?

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.810
Yes. Daichi, you should escape.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.400
Huh?! Y-You dumbass!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.980
I'm a Summoner, chosen the same as you!

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:55.280
You don't use the summoning
app right at all, do ya?

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.570
Aah, shut up. Watch THIS!

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.870
I'll get some super-strong demon--

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.080
Gimme that a sec.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.290
Cut it out!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.170
C'mon, it's not like you need it.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:06.330
I don't, but...

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.330
Then listen to me.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.710
It's mine! Then listen to me.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.760
Hibiki.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:16.970
What's this?

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:21.890
Data on everything I've dug up
on JP's and the Hotsuin family.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.140
For me?

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.270
You're the first person
I'll tell it all to.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.610
If you wish to act of your own
will, I'll give it to you.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.810
The future of the human race
is for no man to govern.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.530
Please, don't make the wrong decision.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:40.360
That's right.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:46.000
If Yamato is in the wrong,
then I should stop him.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.780
That thing is hard!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.700
Sarasvati!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:47.830
Hagen!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.040
Cait-Sith!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:51.660
Neko Shogun.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.260
It can heal itself?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.050
No fair!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.050
So that's it, eh?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.390
How are the other locations doin'?

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:12.890
Nitto!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.560
Hibiki!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:20.730
Huh. I haven't seen 'em in a while,
and now they're totally in sync.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:24.320
Don't count me out! Go, my demon!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.280
Heqet!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.670
My demons are weak!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.590
Look out! Fall back!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:42.920
That's...

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.800
Berserk!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.550
We gotta fight to avenge Keita's death.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.600
Awesome. Such fighting strength!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.080
A demon's strength depends
on the human usin' it!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:05.530
Yes?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.450
Kuze.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.820
We've confirmed it on our end as well.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.660
That is the creature's core!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.120
Right there, huh?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.700
It's the same as with Merak.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:16.490
Byakko!

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.260
Whoa!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.220
Yes!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:29.470
No.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.100
Manifestation readings have
drastically increased!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:43.570
It can't be...

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.860
It regenerated!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:47.860
THIS is what it means for
our attacks to be useless?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.790
Yo, what is that?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:53.490
Run!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:09.920
Baal.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.720
Rein that thing in for a while.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.020
Cerberus.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.830
Weaklings.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.080
You would challenge
ME, up above Ryumyaku?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.540
That's the bureau chief's....

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.550
True power?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:49.640
Hibiki. Former detective.
Can you hear me?

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.240
Keep attacking, and don't let up.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.970
Get that core exposed.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.930
Unless we stop all three at once,

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.640
Megrez will regenerate indefinitely.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:04.150
I'll make things match your timing.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.700
That's the only thing it can do, huh?

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.710
We can't let it get to the tower!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.750
That's good. Over there!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.730
Hibiki! He's over your way!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.730
Understood!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.690
Does that thing not run out of bullets?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.690
We gotta hurry and finish this...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.990
Or Tsutenkaku is done for!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.530
We have to settle this, here!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.290
Your friends' dead
face clip has arrived!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.090
Ronaldo and the others...

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.640
What? A dead face clip?

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.270
Please leave there at once!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:23.590
I see.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.480
Thank you. I'll be careful.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.730
What are you saying?! It's dangerous!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.990
Well, nothin' to it but to do it.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.320
Only WE can do this.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.240
None of the other Summoners
can defeat Megrez.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.310
We can avoid what is shown
in the dead face clip.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.370
You proved that yourself yesterday.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.300
We don't intend to die, either!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:48.630
Ronaldo!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.670
No, Hibiki! The enemy's coming!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:55.310
Both of you, fall back if you
feel things get dangerous.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.590
Don't do anything reckless.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.010
Yes, we know.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:03.480
I can't die in a place like this.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.270
I don't know what "reckless" is anymore.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.180
Same here.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.520
Don't die in vain.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.990
Same goes for you.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.450
I won't allow anyone to die here.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.240
You will survive!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.950
Megrez O is 3.5 km from Tsutenkaku!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.650
Megrez N is 580 meters
from the Nagoya TV tower!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:27.750
Outnumbered, aren't we?

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.420
Go to Plan B! Are we ready?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:43.320
Airi?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.890
It's already come that far?

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:03.580
The memories... Of me and Papa...

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.960
Now! Drop it!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:12.800
Gotcha!

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.310
They planted explosives
in the basement?!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.060
Do it, Sako!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.520
Begin the attack!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.400
Septentrion!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.450
It's no good!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.540
Nothing we do is stopping it!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.000
Airi, what are you doing?!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:11:00.550
We were just living here as usual,
but my family, my friends...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.570
They're all dead!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.850
They couldn't do anything...

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.770
They didn't know anything!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.020
I don't care if you're
God or the devil:

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.070
That sort of thing isn't right!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:19.810
I won't forgive these guys
for killing everyone!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.570
Get 'em, Lorelei!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.410
This is the end!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.600
Baal. Finish it.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:54.560
Simultaneous core exposure confirmed!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:55.900
Attack in unison!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:56.770
Byakko!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:57.400
Hagen!

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:58.650
Cerberus.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.470
Don't move.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.360
I ain't... I'm not crying!

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.270
We...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:39.760
We did it!

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:52.330
Destruction of the three
Megrez is confirmed.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.090
Ronaldo! Ronaldo!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.340
Ronaldo! Everyone!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.970
Otome? Otome?!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.420
Jungo?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.260
That's blood, right?!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.010
I am fine.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.830
No way... Oh, how are the others?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.290
Hey!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.040
You playing around?! Come on out!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:43.130
This isn't funny!
Jeez, you can't just be dead!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.610
Makoto. The situation has ended.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:10.740
Situation ended.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.830
This is terrible!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.380
Airi. Let's go back.
You'll catch a cold.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.130
Go back to where?!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.840
We don't have a home!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:27.780
Airi.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.600
Otome...

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.170
Mom...

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.150
It can't be.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.750
It just can't.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.240
Hibiki.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:44.890
I know.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:49.030
Everyone did what they chose to do.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:50.940
The same as me.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.510
It's what I chose!

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.340
Airi.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.590
What's that? What's going on?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.680
There's no sky.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.520
Over there.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:19.770
There's nothing.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.370
You're all right with this, sir?

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.960
With what?

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.810
What happened to the Nagoya Branch.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.740
We defeated the fourth Septentrion.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.250
That's all that counts.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.690
The enchanted spear that's

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:54.090
been kept by the Hotsuin family
for generations: Brionac.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.410
It's been continually
adjusted till today but...

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.600
Now it's up to the one
who can actually use it.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.550
Irrelevant. There isn't
the luxury of choice.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.420
Indeed.

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:16.990
Ronaldo, Otome...

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.430
Everyone, there was no
meaning to their deaths.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.550
What are the Septentriones?

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:25.840
Why do they attack?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:31.300
If this is a dream...
please let me wake up!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.010
It depends on how you
perceive it, but...

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:39.300
To put this in words you all
would use, "This is reality."

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.130
Alcor.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.600
Three enemies remaining.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.190
Demon!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:53.410
Is it fun for demons to
toy with humans this way?!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.700
Some of them probably think so,

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.540
but you have the wrong idea.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.280
I'm not a demon.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:06.170
Then won't you help humanity?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:10.550
You have the power to make
the dead face clips, right?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.250
"Help"?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.720
I can't do that.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.730
Why not?!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.220
This is humanity's trial.

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:24.730
Unless it shows its own potentiality,
it will achieve nothing.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.010
"Trial," you say?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:31.730
Just what has the right to
test humanity like that?

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:34.910
Polaris.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.450
The Almighty Administrator of Order.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.810
Polaris?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:45.500
Polaris has arrived at
the conclusion that,

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.270
to preserve order in this world,

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.800
mankind's existence is
not the most beautiful.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.500
Is it... God?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.500
It depends on how you perceive things,

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.410
so some people probably think so.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.730
But it merely seeks to protect
the world's natural order.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:07.020
Humans are a strange form of life.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.480
Though having lost the
will to keep going,

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:13.030
they unconsciously continue to prosper.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.950
That is artificial in terms
of the natural order.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.080
That's probably what Polaris thinks.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:23.490
It may be artificial, but that's
a skewed way of looking at things.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.870
It's no excuse to go
and destroy everything!

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.290
Yes. You're right.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.130
I think so, the same as you.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.620
Even though, by rights,

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:40.300
there's no reason I'd
think such a thing.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.290
No reason you'd think so?

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.260
Why not?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.270
Because I'm the Sword of Polaris.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.310
A Septentrion.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.950
The Septentriones are

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:57.430
mechanisms for maintaining
order as Polaris sees fit.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.750
You're one of them?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:04.910
I'm just a mechanism, so I shouldn't
have had such awareness.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.420
Shouldn't have?

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:12.040
Though just a mechanism, I think
of humans, grieve for them.

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:16.020
For something like me to have been born,

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:19.300
perhaps Polaris isn't
almighty after all.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:25.230
That's why you gave humanity
the weapon that is

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.740
the Demon-summoning App?

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.980
I gave them a choice.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.320
If humans want to survive,

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:35.510
they'll need a chance to
show Polaris their will.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:41.080
As a mechanism, I can't act
against Polaris directly,

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:44.280
but I can give you all that choice.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.170
Confused, aren't you?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.120
Of course.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.020
How should I take in a story like that?

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.750
I'm confused, too.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.300
Why have I come to have this conscience?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:06.470
If it's this agonizing,
I shouldn't have had it.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.980
Just what am I?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.810
Will you not accept my
story, O Sparkling One?

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.180
Does Yamato know all this?

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:25.180
Yes. Yamato knows it all.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.170
That unless you display your
will, make your choice,

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.630
this world will return to the Void.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.420
What's that?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.870
Ah, that. It's the Void.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.180
What... is it?

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.510
Nothing resides there.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:51.300
Not matter, not time, not even ideals.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.330
That is the Void.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:59.170
THIS is what he meant by the
world will "be no more"?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:02.150
I thought it was more like destruction.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:09.560
Civilization, history, the world...

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.360
The fact that humans ever existed here,

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:18.190
the very ideal of humanity
itself, will be utterly erased.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:20.640
It'll be erased.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.970
The life, the feelings that
were there, all of it.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.560
It will never have existed.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:33.620
Seven days of judgment were promised.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:38.720
When humanity has overcome all trials,

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:41.470
then it can finally stand before
Polaris for arbitration.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:48.910
The world of the humans,

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:50.200
whom I have watched over for so long...

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:54.800
The world of the humans,
whom I have raised,

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.350
will disappear.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:01.740
I don't wish to lose you.

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.220
So, it's come this far?

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:12.640
The erosion of the Void.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.480
This is all that remains of the world.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.780
Though we knew it was coming,
it's pretty shocking, huh?

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.480
This is...!

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:30.070
The disappearance not of matter
but of awareness, of ideals.

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:33.830
Not death. Something even more pure.

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:37.460
The fact that we life
forms ever existed...

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:42.480
Our past, present and future,
it will all disappear.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:47.500
Why?

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:52.350
Why does humanity have to go
through such a brutal trial?

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:54.600
I'll defeat the enemy.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:58.830
But having lost so much,
there's no point even if

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:00.230
this world does survive.

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:03.580
Isn't there something than
can be done to save it?

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:07.730
I don't believe that it can be saved.

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:14.250
The world...

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:17.600
will disappear.
